    "yourself": "自己",
    "— and Gran. Gran last of all, holding on longest.": "——然后是奶奶。她坚持得最久，是最后一个。",
    "— by a *something*. And she's meant to be rescued by a —": "——被一个*什么东西*抓住。然后应该有一个……",
    "— by a *something*. And she's meant to be rescued by a — a — I can't remember who rescues her. Gran Mab would know. Gran Mab knows everything.": "——被一个*什么东西*抓住。然后应该有一个……一个……我想不起来是谁救了她。梅布奶奶一定知道。她什么都知道。",
    "— the ink is still wet —": "——墨迹未干——",
    "← → Targets · ↑ ↓ Verbs · A Interact · B Satchel · X Book · Y Menu · START Pause": "← → 选择目标 · ↑ ↓ 选择动作 · A 互动 · B 背包 · X 书本 · Y 菜单 · START 暂停",
